OL,3,GNEWSANew law could stop killers'
OL,4,Aparental rights in NI
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople convicted of killing a person
OL,7,Fwith whom they share a child could be
OL,8,Fautomatically stripped of their
OL,9,Fparental responsibility under potential
OL,10,Fnew legislation.
OL,12,FThe proposed changes to family law are
OL,13,Fbeing considered in a public
OL,14,Fconsultation, which was launched on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FThe consultation will also explore
OL,18,Fwhether offenders of other serious
OL,19,Fcrimes could have their rights to their
OL,20,Fchildren restricted.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
