OL,3,GNEWSANew law could stop killers'
OL,4,Aparental rights in NI
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn September, BBC News NI reported
OL,7,Fcalls for legislative change from a
OL,8,Fwoman who was fighting to stop her sex
OL,9,Foffender ex-husband having contact with
OL,10,Ftheir child.
